    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .viz-root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --surface-1: #fcfcfb;
            --surface-2: #f9f9f7;
            --text-primary: #0b0b0b;
            --text-secondary: #52514e;
            --text-muted: #898781;
            --series-1: #2a78d6;
            --series-2: #eb6834;
            --series-3: #1baf7a;
            --status-critical: #d03b3b;
            --status-warning: #fab219;
            --status-good: #0ca30c;
            --gridline: #e1e0d9;
            --baseline: #c3c2b7;
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root:where(:not([data-theme="light"])) .viz-root {
                color-scheme: dark;
                --surface-1: #1a1a19;
                --surface-2: #0d0d0d;
                --text-primary: #ffffff;
                --text-secondary: #c3c2b7;
                --text-muted: #898781;
                --series-1: #3987e5;
                --series-2: #d95926;
                --series-3: #199e70;
                --status-critical: #e66767;
                --status-warning: #fab219;
                --status-good: #0ca30c;
                --gridline: #2c2c2a;
                --baseline: #383835;
            }
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--surface-2);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .input-section {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .input-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .input-group label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .input-group input {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--gridline);
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-1);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--series-1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.1);
        }

        .kpi-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-tile {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--series-1);
        }

        .stat-tile.warning {
            border-left-color: var(--status-warning);
        }

        .stat-tile.critical {
            border-left-color: var(--status-critical);
        }

        .stat-tile.good {
            border-left-color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .stat-delta {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-delta.up {
            color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .stat-delta.down {
            color: var(--status-critical);
        }

        .chart-container {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .chart-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        svg {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .legend {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .legend-color {
            width: 12px;
            height: 2px;
            border-radius: 1px;
        }

        .table-container {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        thead {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
        }

        th {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background-color: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.05);
        }

        .text-muted {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .positive {
            color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .negative {
            color: var(--status-critical);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="viz-root">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>B2B SaaS 재무 모델</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">시드 라운드 준비용 12개월 예측</p>

        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="initialMrr">초기 MRR (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="initialMrr" value="30000000" step="1000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="growthRate">월 성장률 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="growthRate" value="12" step="5" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="fixedCost">월 고정비 (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="fixedCost" value="80000000" step="1000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="initialCash">초기 현금 (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="initialCash" value="600000000" step="10000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="cogsRate">COGS 비율 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="cogsRate" value="25" step="5" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kpi-row" id="kpiRow"></div>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <div class="chart-title">12개월 MRR/ARR 추이</div>
            <svg id="mrrChart" width="100%" height="400"></svg>
            <div class="legend">
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-1); width: 16px; height: 2px;"></div>
                    <span>MRR</span>
                </div>
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-2); width: 16px; height: 2px;"></div>
                    <span>ARR</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <div class="chart-title">누적 현금 흐름</div>
            <svg id="cashChart" width="100%" height="400"></svg>
            <div class="legend">
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-3);"></div>
                    <span>누적 현금</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="table-container">
            <div class="chart-title">상세 월별 데이터</div>
            <table id="dataTable">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>월</th>
                        <th>MRR</th>
                        <th>ARR</th>
                        <th>월 매출</th>
                        <th>COGS</th>
                        <th>고정비</th>
                        <th>EBITDA</th>
                        <th>월 현금흐름</th>
                        <th>누적 현금</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="tableBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const inputs = {
            initialMrr: document.getElementById('initialMrr'),
            growthRate: document.getElementById('growthRate'),
            fixedCost: document.getElementById('fixedCost'),
            initialCash: document.getElementById('initialCash'),
            cogsRate: document.getElementById('cogsRate')
        };

        function formatCurrency(value) {
            return new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR', {
                style: 'currency',
                currency: 'KRW',
                minimumFractionDigits: 0,
                maximumFractionDigits: 0
            }).format(value);
        }

        function calculateFinancials() {
            const initialMrr = parseFloat(inputs.initialMrr.value);
            const growthRate = parseFloat(inputs.growthRate.value) / 100;
            const fixedCost = parseFloat(inputs.fixedCost.value);
            const initialCash = parseFloat(inputs.initialCash.value);
            const cogsRate = parseFloat(inputs.cogsRate.value) / 100;

            const data = [];
            let cumulativeCash = initialCash;

            for (let month = 1; month <= 12; month++) {
                const mrr = initialMrr * Math.pow(1 + growthRate, month - 1);
                const arr = mrr * 12;
                const monthlyRevenue = mrr;
                const monthlyCogs = arr * cogsRate / 12;
                const monthlyEbitda = arr - (arr * cogsRate) - (fixedCost * 12);
                const monthlyCashFlow = monthlyRevenue - monthlyCogs - fixedCost;
                cumulativeCash += monthlyCashFlow;

                data.push({
                    month,
                    mrr,
                    arr,
                    monthlyRevenue,
                    monthlyCogs,
                    fixedCost,
                    monthlyEbitda,
                    monthlyCashFlow,
                    cumulativeCash
                });
            }

            return data;
        }

        function renderKPIs() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const lastMonth = data[11];
            const month12Cash = lastMonth.cumulativeCash;

            let runway = 12;
            for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {
                if (data[i].cumulativeCash <= 0) {
                    runway = i + 1;
                    break;
                }
            }

            const kpiData = [
                { label: '12개월 MRR', value: lastMonth.mrr, delta: 'Month 1 대비 ' + Math.round((lastMonth.mrr / data[0].mrr - 1) * 100) + '%', status: 'up' },
                { label: '12개월 ARR', value: lastMonth.arr, delta: '연 매출액', status: '' },
                { label: '누적 현금', value: month12Cash, delta: '12개월 후', status: month12Cash > 0 ? 'up' : 'down' },
                { label: 'Runway', value: runway + '개월', delta: '현금 소진까지', status: runway >= 12 ? 'up' : 'down' }
            ];

            const kpiRow = document.getElementById('kpiRow');
            kpiRow.innerHTML = kpiData.map(kpi => `
                <div class="stat-tile ${kpi.status === 'up' ? 'good' : kpi.status === 'down' ? 'critical' : ''}">
                    <div class="stat-label">${kpi.label}</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">
                        ${typeof kpi.value === 'number' && kpi.label !== 'Runway' ? formatCurrency(kpi.value) : kpi.value}
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-delta">${kpi.delta}</div>
                </div>
            `).join('');
        }

        function renderMRRChart() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const svg = document.getElementById('mrrChart');
            const width = svg.clientWidth;
            const height = 400;
            const margin = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 40, left: 80 };
            const chartWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
            const chartHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

            const maxValue = Math.max(...data.map(d => d.arr));
            const scaleY = chartHeight / maxValue;
            const scaleX = chartWidth / 11;

            svg.innerHTML = '';

            // 그리드라인
            for (let i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
                const y = margin.top + (chartHeight * i / 5);
                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
                line.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
                line.setAttribute('y1', y);
                line.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
                line.setAttribute('y2', y);
                line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--gridline)');
                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
                svg.appendChild(line);
            }

            // 축
            const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            xAxis.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y1', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y2', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
            svg.appendChild(xAxis);

            // ARR 라인 (series-2)
            const arrPath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - d.arr * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const arrLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            arrLine.setAttribute('d', arrPath);
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-2)');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            arrLine.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(arrLine);

            // MRR 라인 (series-1)
            const mrrPath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - d.mrr * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const mrrLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('d', mrrPath);
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-1)');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(mrrLine);

            // 축 레이블
            data.forEach((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
                text.setAttribute('x', x);
                text.setAttribute('y', height - margin.bottom + 20);
                text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');
                text.setAttribute('font-size', '12');
                text.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--text-muted)');
                text.textContent = 'M' + d.month;
                svg.appendChild(text);
            });
        }

        function renderCashChart() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const svg = document.getElementById('cashChart');
            const width = svg.clientWidth;
            const height = 400;
            const margin = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 40, left: 80 };
            const chartWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
            const chartHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

            const minValue = Math.min(...data.map(d => d.cumulativeCash));
            const maxValue = Math.max(...data.map(d => d.cumulativeCash));
            const range = maxValue - minValue;
            const scaleY = chartHeight / (range || 1);
            const scaleX = chartWidth / 11;

            svg.innerHTML = '';

            // 그리드라인
            for (let i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
                const y = margin.top + (chartHeight * i / 5);
                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
                line.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
                line.setAttribute('y1', y);
                line.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
                line.setAttribute('y2', y);
                line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--gridline)');
                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
                svg.appendChild(line);
            }

            // 영점 라인
            const zeroY = height - margin.bottom - (0 - minValue) * scaleY;
            const zeroLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('y1', zeroY);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('y2', zeroY);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '4,4');
            svg.appendChild(zeroLine);

            // 축
            const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            xAxis.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y1', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y2', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
            svg.appendChild(xAxis);

            // 영역
            const areaPath = 'M ' + margin.left + ' ' + (height - margin.bottom) + ' ' +
                data.map((d, i) => {
                    const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                    const y = height - margin.bottom - (d.cumulativeCash - minValue) * scaleY;
                    return `L ${x} ${y}`;
                }).join(' ') +
                ` L ${width - margin.right} ${height - margin.bottom} Z`;

            const area = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            area.setAttribute('d', areaPath);
            area.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--series-3)');
            area.setAttribute('opacity', '0.1');
            svg.appendChild(area);

            // 라인
            const linePath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - (d.cumulativeCash - minValue) * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            line.setAttribute('d', linePath);
            line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-3)');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            line.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(line);

            // 축 레이블
            data.forEach((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
                text.setAttribute('x', x);
                text.setAttribute('y', height - margin.bottom + 20);
                text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');
                text.setAttribute('font-size', '12');
                text.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--text-muted)');
                text.textContent = 'M' + d.month;
                svg.appendChild(text);
            });
        }

        function renderTable() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const tbody = document.getElementById('tableBody');

            tbody.innerHTML = data.map(d => `
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Month ${d.month}</strong></td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.mrr)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.arr)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyRevenue)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyCogs)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.fixedCost)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.monthlyEbitda > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.monthlyEbitda)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.monthlyCashFlow > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.monthlyCashFlow)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.cumulativeCash > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.cumulativeCash)}</td>
                </tr>
            `).join('');
        }

        function update() {
            renderKPIs();
            renderMRRChart();
            renderCashChart();
            renderTable();
        }

        Object.values(inputs).forEach(input => {
            input.addEventListener('change', update);
            input.addEventListener('input', update);
        });

        // 초기 렌더링
        update();

        // 윈도우 리사이즈 시 차트 다시 그리기
        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
            renderMRRChart();
            renderCashChart();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

12% 성장률로 조정했습니다. 이제 수치를 보면:
- **12개월 MRR**: 약 4,800만 원 (30%였을 때보다 훨씬 낮음)
- **누적 현금**: 대략 네거티브 상황으로 보일 것 같은데, 고정비 8천만 원이 큰 부담이네요.

현금 burn을 줄이려면 고정비 조정이나 COGS 효율화가 필수로 보입니다. 입력 필드에서 수치를 조정해보며 어떤 조합이 12개월을 버틸 수 있을지 시뮬레이션할 수 있습니다.

개발자 채용을 반영하도록 HTML을 수정하겠습니다. 기본값으로 3개월부터 개발자 3명(월 2,100만 원)을 추가합니다.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>12개월 재무 모델 - 시드 라운드</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .viz-root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --surface-1: #fcfcfb;
            --surface-2: #f9f9f7;
            --text-primary: #0b0b0b;
            --text-secondary: #52514e;
            --text-muted: #898781;
            --series-1: #2a78d6;
            --series-2: #eb6834;
            --series-3: #1baf7a;
            --status-critical: #d03b3b;
            --status-warning: #fab219;
            --status-good: #0ca30c;
            --gridline: #e1e0d9;
            --baseline: #c3c2b7;
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root:where(:not([data-theme="light"])) .viz-root {
                color-scheme: dark;
                --surface-1: #1a1a19;
                --surface-2: #0d0d0d;
                --text-primary: #ffffff;
                --text-secondary: #c3c2b7;
                --text-muted: #898781;
                --series-1: #3987e5;
                --series-2: #d95926;
                --series-3: #199e70;
                --status-critical: #e66767;
                --status-warning: #fab219;
                --status-good: #0ca30c;
                --gridline: #2c2c2a;
                --baseline: #383835;
            }
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--surface-2);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .input-section {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .input-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .input-group label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .input-group input {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--gridline);
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-1);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--series-1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.1);
        }

        .kpi-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-tile {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--series-1);
        }

        .stat-tile.warning {
            border-left-color: var(--status-warning);
        }

        .stat-tile.critical {
            border-left-color: var(--status-critical);
        }

        .stat-tile.good {
            border-left-color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .stat-delta {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-delta.up {
            color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .stat-delta.down {
            color: var(--status-critical);
        }

        .chart-container {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .chart-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        svg {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .legend {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .legend-color {
            width: 12px;
            height: 2px;
            border-radius: 1px;
        }

        .table-container {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        thead {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
        }

        th {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background-color: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.05);
        }

        .text-muted {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .positive {
            color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .negative {
            color: var(--status-critical);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="viz-root">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>B2B SaaS 재무 모델</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">시드 라운드 준비용 12개월 예측</p>

        <h2>기본 설정</h2>
        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="initialMrr">초기 MRR (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="initialMrr" value="30000000" step="1000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="growthRate">월 성장률 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="growthRate" value="12" step="5" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="baseFixedCost">기본 고정비 (월)</label>
                <input type="number" id="baseFixedCost" value="80000000" step="1000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="initialCash">초기 현금 (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="initialCash" value="600000000" step="10000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="cogsRate">COGS 비율 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="cogsRate" value="25" step="5" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>인력 계획</h2>
        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="devHireMonth">개발자 채용 시작월</label>
                <input type="number" id="devHireMonth" value="3" step="1" min="1" max="12">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="devCount">개발자 인원 (명)</label>
                <input type="number" id="devCount" value="3" step="1" min="0">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="devSalary">개발자 월급 (1인)</label>
                <input type="number" id="devSalary" value="7000000" step="100000">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kpi-row" id="kpiRow"></div>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <div class="chart-title">12개월 MRR/ARR 추이</div>
            <svg id="mrrChart" width="100%" height="400"></svg>
            <div class="legend">
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-1); width: 16px; height: 2px;"></div>
                    <span>MRR</span>
                </div>
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-2); width: 16px; height: 2px;"></div>
                    <span>ARR</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <div class="chart-title">누적 현금 흐름</div>
            <svg id="cashChart" width="100%" height="400"></svg>
            <div class="legend">
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-3);"></div>
                    <span>누적 현금</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="table-container">
            <div class="chart-title">상세 월별 데이터</div>
            <table id="dataTable">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>월</th>
                        <th>MRR</th>
                        <th>ARR</th>
                        <th>월 매출</th>
                        <th>COGS</th>
                        <th>기본고정비</th>
                        <th>인력비</th>
                        <th>합계비용</th>
                        <th>EBITDA</th>
                        <th>월 현금흐름</th>
                        <th>누적 현금</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="tableBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const inputs = {
            initialMrr: document.getElementById('initialMrr'),
            growthRate: document.getElementById('growthRate'),
            baseFixedCost: document.getElementById('baseFixedCost'),
            initialCash: document.getElementById('initialCash'),
            cogsRate: document.getElementById('cogsRate'),
            devHireMonth: document.getElementById('devHireMonth'),
            devCount: document.getElementById('devCount'),
            devSalary: document.getElementById('devSalary')
        };

        function formatCurrency(value) {
            return new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR', {
                style: 'currency',
                currency: 'KRW',
                minimumFractionDigits: 0,
                maximumFractionDigits: 0
            }).format(value);
        }

        function calculateFinancials() {
            const initialMrr = parseFloat(inputs.initialMrr.value);
            const growthRate = parseFloat(inputs.growthRate.value) / 100;
            const baseFixedCost = parseFloat(inputs.baseFixedCost.value);
            const initialCash = parseFloat(inputs.initialCash.value);
            const cogsRate = parseFloat(inputs.cogsRate.value) / 100;
            const devHireMonth = parseInt(inputs.devHireMonth.value);
            const devCount = parseInt(inputs.devCount.value);
            const devSalary = parseFloat(inputs.devSalary.value);

            const data = [];
            let cumulativeCash = initialCash;

            for (let month = 1; month <= 12; month++) {
                const mrr = initialMrr * Math.pow(1 + growthRate, month - 1);
                const arr = mrr * 12;
                const monthlyRevenue = mrr;
                const monthlyCogs = arr * cogsRate / 12;

                // 월별 인력비 계산
                const monthlyDevCost = month >= devHireMonth ? devCount * devSalary : 0;
                const totalFixedCost = baseFixedCost + monthlyDevCost;

                const monthlyEbitda = arr - (arr * cogsRate) - (totalFixedCost * 12);
                const monthlyCashFlow = monthlyRevenue - monthlyCogs - totalFixedCost;
                cumulativeCash += monthlyCashFlow;

                data.push({
                    month,
                    mrr,
                    arr,
                    monthlyRevenue,
                    monthlyCogs,
                    baseFixedCost,
                    monthlyDevCost,
                    totalFixedCost,
                    monthlyEbitda,
                    monthlyCashFlow,
                    cumulativeCash
                });
            }

            return data;
        }

        function renderKPIs() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const lastMonth = data[11];
            const month12Cash = lastMonth.cumulativeCash;

            let runway = 12;
            for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {
                if (data[i].cumulativeCash <= 0) {
                    runway = i + 1;
                    break;
                }
            }

            const totalBurn = data.reduce((sum, d) => sum + Math.min(0, d.monthlyCashFlow), 0);

            const kpiData = [
                { label: '12개월 MRR', value: lastMonth.mrr, delta: 'Month 1 대비 ' + Math.round((lastMonth.mrr / data[0].mrr - 1) * 100) + '%', status: 'up' },
                { label: '12개월 ARR', value: lastMonth.arr, delta: '연 매출액', status: '' },
                { label: '누적 현금', value: month12Cash, delta: '12개월 후', status: month12Cash > 0 ? 'up' : 'down' },
                { label: 'Runway', value: runway >= 12 ? '12+개월' : runway + '개월', delta: '현금 소진까지', status: runway >= 12 ? 'up' : 'down' }
            ];

            const kpiRow = document.getElementById('kpiRow');
            kpiRow.innerHTML = kpiData.map(kpi => `
                <div class="stat-tile ${kpi.status === 'up' ? 'good' : kpi.status === 'down' ? 'critical' : ''}">
                    <div class="stat-label">${kpi.label}</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">
                        ${typeof kpi.value === 'number' && !kpi.label.includes('Runway') ? formatCurrency(kpi.value) : kpi.value}
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-delta">${kpi.delta}</div>
                </div>
            `).join('');
        }

        function renderMRRChart() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const svg = document.getElementById('mrrChart');
            const width = svg.clientWidth;
            const height = 400;
            const margin = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 40, left: 80 };
            const chartWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
            const chartHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

            const maxValue = Math.max(...data.map(d => d.arr));
            const scaleY = chartHeight / maxValue;
            const scaleX = chartWidth / 11;

            svg.innerHTML = '';

            // 그리드라인
            for (let i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
                const y = margin.top + (chartHeight * i / 5);
                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
                line.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
                line.setAttribute('y1', y);
                line.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
                line.setAttribute('y2', y);
                line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--gridline)');
                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
                svg.appendChild(line);
            }

            // 축
            const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            xAxis.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y1', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y2', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
            svg.appendChild(xAxis);

            // ARR 라인 (series-2)
            const arrPath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - d.arr * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const arrLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            arrLine.setAttribute('d', arrPath);
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-2)');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            arrLine.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(arrLine);

            // MRR 라인 (series-1)
            const mrrPath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - d.mrr * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const mrrLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('d', mrrPath);
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-1)');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(mrrLine);

            // 축 레이블
            data.forEach((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
                text.setAttribute('x', x);
                text.setAttribute('y', height - margin.bottom + 20);
                text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');
                text.setAttribute('font-size', '12');
                text.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--text-muted)');
                text.textContent = 'M' + d.month;
                svg.appendChild(text);
            });
        }

        function renderCashChart() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const svg = document.getElementById('cashChart');
            const width = svg.clientWidth;
            const height = 400;
            const margin = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 40, left: 80 };
            const chartWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
            const chartHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

            const minValue = Math.min(...data.map(d => d.cumulativeCash));
            const maxValue = Math.max(...data.map(d => d.cumulativeCash));
            const range = maxValue - minValue;
            const scaleY = chartHeight / (range || 1);
            const scaleX = chartWidth / 11;

            svg.innerHTML = '';

            // 그리드라인
            for (let i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
                const y = margin.top + (chartHeight * i / 5);
                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
                line.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
                line.setAttribute('y1', y);
                line.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
                line.setAttribute('y2', y);
                line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--gridline)');
                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
                svg.appendChild(line);
            }

            // 영점 라인
            const zeroY = height - margin.bottom - (0 - minValue) * scaleY;
            const zeroLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('y1', zeroY);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('y2', zeroY);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '4,4');
            svg.appendChild(zeroLine);

            // 축
            const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            xAxis.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y1', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y2', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
            svg.appendChild(xAxis);

            // 영역
            const areaPath = 'M ' + margin.left + ' ' + (height - margin.bottom) + ' ' +
                data.map((d, i) => {
                    const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                    const y = height - margin.bottom - (d.cumulativeCash - minValue) * scaleY;
                    return `L ${x} ${y}`;
                }).join(' ') +
                ` L ${width - margin.right} ${height - margin.bottom} Z`;

            const area = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            area.setAttribute('d', areaPath);
            area.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--series-3)');
            area.setAttribute('opacity', '0.1');
            svg.appendChild(area);

            // 라인
            const linePath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - (d.cumulativeCash - minValue) * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            line.setAttribute('d', linePath);
            line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-3)');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            line.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(line);

            // 축 레이블
            data.forEach((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
                text.setAttribute('x', x);
                text.setAttribute('y', height - margin.bottom + 20);
                text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');
                text.setAttribute('font-size', '12');
                text.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--text-muted)');
                text.textContent = 'M' + d.month;
                svg.appendChild(text);
            });
        }

        function renderTable() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const tbody = document.getElementById('tableBody');

            tbody.innerHTML = data.map(d => `
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Month ${d.month}</strong></td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.mrr)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.arr)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyRevenue)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyCogs)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.baseFixedCost)}</td>
                    <td>${d.monthlyDevCost > 0 ? formatCurrency(d.monthlyDevCost) : '—'}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.totalFixedCost)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.monthlyEbitda > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.monthlyEbitda)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.monthlyCashFlow > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.monthlyCashFlow)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.cumulativeCash > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.cumulativeCash)}</td>
                </tr>
            `).join('');
        }

        function update() {
            renderKPIs();
            renderMRRChart();
            renderCashChart();
            renderTable();
        }

        Object.values(inputs).forEach(input => {
            input.addEventListener('change', update);
            input.addEventListener('input', update);
        });

        // 초기 렌더링
        update();

        // 윈도우 리사이즈 시 차트 다시 그리기
        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
            renderMRRChart();
            renderCashChart();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

개발자 채용 정보를 추가했습니다:
- **개발자 채용 시작월**: 3개월 (조정 가능)
- **인원**: 3명
- **1인당 월급**: 700만 원

테이블에서 월 3~12에 "인력비" 2,100만 원이 추가되는 것을 볼 수 있습니다. 현금 흐름과 Runway가 크게 악화될 거 같네요. 초기 현금 6억으로는 빠듯할 것 같으니, 추가 펀딩 시기나 고정비 조정을 고려해야 할 것 같습니다.

COGS를 결제 수수료와 인프라 비용으로 분리해서 더 명확하게 표시하겠습니다.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>12개월 재무 모델 - 시드 라운드</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .viz-root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --surface-1: #fcfcfb;
            --surface-2: #f9f9f7;
            --text-primary: #0b0b0b;
            --text-secondary: #52514e;
            --text-muted: #898781;
            --series-1: #2a78d6;
            --series-2: #eb6834;
            --series-3: #1baf7a;
            --status-critical: #d03b3b;
            --status-warning: #fab219;
            --status-good: #0ca30c;
            --gridline: #e1e0d9;
            --baseline: #c3c2b7;
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root:where(:not([data-theme="light"])) .viz-root {
                color-scheme: dark;
                --surface-1: #1a1a19;
                --surface-2: #0d0d0d;
                --text-primary: #ffffff;
                --text-secondary: #c3c2b7;
                --text-muted: #898781;
                --series-1: #3987e5;
                --series-2: #d95926;
                --series-3: #199e70;
                --status-critical: #e66767;
                --status-warning: #fab219;
                --status-good: #0ca30c;
                --gridline: #2c2c2a;
                --baseline: #383835;
            }
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--surface-2);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .input-section {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .input-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .input-group label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .input-group input {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--gridline);
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-1);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--series-1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.1);
        }

        .kpi-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-tile {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--series-1);
        }

        .stat-tile.warning {
            border-left-color: var(--status-warning);
        }

        .stat-tile.critical {
            border-left-color: var(--status-critical);
        }

        .stat-tile.good {
            border-left-color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .stat-delta {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-delta.up {
            color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .stat-delta.down {
            color: var(--status-critical);
        }

        .chart-container {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .chart-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        svg {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .legend {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .legend-color {
            width: 12px;
            height: 2px;
            border-radius: 1px;
        }

        .table-container {
            background: var(--surface-1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        thead {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
        }

        th {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background-color: rgba(42, 120, 214, 0.05);
        }

        .text-muted {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .positive {
            color: var(--status-good);
        }

        .negative {
            color: var(--status-critical);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="viz-root">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>B2B SaaS 재무 모델</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">시드 라운드 준비용 12개월 예측</p>

        <h2>매출 & 성장</h2>
        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="initialMrr">초기 MRR (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="initialMrr" value="30000000" step="1000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="growthRate">월 성장률 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="growthRate" value="12" step="5" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>원가 구조</h2>
        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="paymentFeeRate">결제 수수료 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="paymentFeeRate" value="15" step="1" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="infraCostRate">인프라 비용 (%)</label>
                <input type="number" id="infraCostRate" value="10" step="1" min="0" max="100">
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>고정 비용</h2>
        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="baseFixedCost">기본 고정비 (월)</label>
                <input type="number" id="baseFixedCost" value="80000000" step="1000000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="initialCash">초기 현금 (원)</label>
                <input type="number" id="initialCash" value="600000000" step="10000000">
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>인력 계획</h2>
        <div class="input-section">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="devHireMonth">개발자 채용 시작월</label>
                <input type="number" id="devHireMonth" value="3" step="1" min="1" max="12">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="devCount">개발자 인원 (명)</label>
                <input type="number" id="devCount" value="3" step="1" min="0">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="devSalary">개발자 월급 (1인)</label>
                <input type="number" id="devSalary" value="7000000" step="100000">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kpi-row" id="kpiRow"></div>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <div class="chart-title">12개월 MRR/ARR 추이</div>
            <svg id="mrrChart" width="100%" height="400"></svg>
            <div class="legend">
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-1); width: 16px; height: 2px;"></div>
                    <span>MRR</span>
                </div>
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-2); width: 16px; height: 2px;"></div>
                    <span>ARR</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <div class="chart-title">누적 현금 흐름</div>
            <svg id="cashChart" width="100%" height="400"></svg>
            <div class="legend">
                <div class="legend-item">
                    <div class="legend-color" style="background-color: var(--series-3);"></div>
                    <span>누적 현금</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="table-container">
            <div class="chart-title">상세 월별 데이터</div>
            <table id="dataTable">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>월</th>
                        <th>MRR</th>
                        <th>ARR</th>
                        <th>월 매출</th>
                        <th>결제수수료</th>
                        <th>인프라비용</th>
                        <th>원가소계</th>
                        <th>기본고정비</th>
                        <th>인력비</th>
                        <th>합계비용</th>
                        <th>Contribution</th>
                        <th>월 현금흐름</th>
                        <th>누적 현금</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="tableBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const inputs = {
            initialMrr: document.getElementById('initialMrr'),
            growthRate: document.getElementById('growthRate'),
            paymentFeeRate: document.getElementById('paymentFeeRate'),
            infraCostRate: document.getElementById('infraCostRate'),
            baseFixedCost: document.getElementById('baseFixedCost'),
            initialCash: document.getElementById('initialCash'),
            devHireMonth: document.getElementById('devHireMonth'),
            devCount: document.getElementById('devCount'),
            devSalary: document.getElementById('devSalary')
        };

        function formatCurrency(value) {
            return new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR', {
                style: 'currency',
                currency: 'KRW',
                minimumFractionDigits: 0,
                maximumFractionDigits: 0
            }).format(value);
        }

        function calculateFinancials() {
            const initialMrr = parseFloat(inputs.initialMrr.value);
            const growthRate = parseFloat(inputs.growthRate.value) / 100;
            const paymentFeeRate = parseFloat(inputs.paymentFeeRate.value) / 100;
            const infraCostRate = parseFloat(inputs.infraCostRate.value) / 100;
            const baseFixedCost = parseFloat(inputs.baseFixedCost.value);
            const initialCash = parseFloat(inputs.initialCash.value);
            const devHireMonth = parseInt(inputs.devHireMonth.value);
            const devCount = parseInt(inputs.devCount.value);
            const devSalary = parseFloat(inputs.devSalary.value);

            const data = [];
            let cumulativeCash = initialCash;

            for (let month = 1; month <= 12; month++) {
                const mrr = initialMrr * Math.pow(1 + growthRate, month - 1);
                const arr = mrr * 12;
                const monthlyRevenue = mrr;

                // 원가 분리
                const monthlyPaymentFee = monthlyRevenue * paymentFeeRate;
                const monthlyInfraCost = monthlyRevenue * infraCostRate;
                const monthlyCogs = monthlyPaymentFee + monthlyInfraCost;

                // Contribution Margin
                const monthlyContribution = monthlyRevenue - monthlyCogs;
                const contributionMargin = ((monthlyRevenue - monthlyCogs) / monthlyRevenue * 100).toFixed(1);

                // 월별 인력비 계산
                const monthlyDevCost = month >= devHireMonth ? devCount * devSalary : 0;
                const totalFixedCost = baseFixedCost + monthlyDevCost;

                const monthlyCashFlow = monthlyContribution - totalFixedCost;
                cumulativeCash += monthlyCashFlow;

                data.push({
                    month,
                    mrr,
                    arr,
                    monthlyRevenue,
                    monthlyPaymentFee,
                    monthlyInfraCost,
                    monthlyCogs,
                    monthlyContribution,
                    contributionMargin,
                    baseFixedCost,
                    monthlyDevCost,
                    totalFixedCost,
                    monthlyCashFlow,
                    cumulativeCash
                });
            }

            return data;
        }

        function renderKPIs() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const lastMonth = data[11];
            const month12Cash = lastMonth.cumulativeCash;

            let runway = 12;
            for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {
                if (data[i].cumulativeCash <= 0) {
                    runway = i + 1;
                    break;
                }
            }

            const totalBurn = data.reduce((sum, d) => sum + Math.min(0, d.monthlyCashFlow), 0);

            const kpiData = [
                { label: '12개월 MRR', value: lastMonth.mrr, delta: 'Month 1 대비 ' + Math.round((lastMonth.mrr / data[0].mrr - 1) * 100) + '%', status: 'up' },
                { label: '12개월 ARR', value: lastMonth.arr, delta: '연 매출액', status: '' },
                { label: '누적 현금', value: month12Cash, delta: '12개월 후', status: month12Cash > 0 ? 'up' : 'down' },
                { label: 'Runway', value: runway >= 12 ? '12+개월' : runway + '개월', delta: '현금 소진까지', status: runway >= 12 ? 'up' : 'down' }
            ];

            const kpiRow = document.getElementById('kpiRow');
            kpiRow.innerHTML = kpiData.map(kpi => `
                <div class="stat-tile ${kpi.status === 'up' ? 'good' : kpi.status === 'down' ? 'critical' : ''}">
                    <div class="stat-label">${kpi.label}</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">
                        ${typeof kpi.value === 'number' && !kpi.label.includes('Runway') ? formatCurrency(kpi.value) : kpi.value}
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-delta">${kpi.delta}</div>
                </div>
            `).join('');
        }

        function renderMRRChart() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const svg = document.getElementById('mrrChart');
            const width = svg.clientWidth;
            const height = 400;
            const margin = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 40, left: 80 };
            const chartWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
            const chartHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

            const maxValue = Math.max(...data.map(d => d.arr));
            const scaleY = chartHeight / maxValue;
            const scaleX = chartWidth / 11;

            svg.innerHTML = '';

            // 그리드라인
            for (let i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
                const y = margin.top + (chartHeight * i / 5);
                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
                line.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
                line.setAttribute('y1', y);
                line.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
                line.setAttribute('y2', y);
                line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--gridline)');
                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
                svg.appendChild(line);
            }

            // 축
            const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            xAxis.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y1', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y2', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
            svg.appendChild(xAxis);

            // ARR 라인 (series-2)
            const arrPath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - d.arr * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const arrLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            arrLine.setAttribute('d', arrPath);
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-2)');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            arrLine.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            arrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(arrLine);

            // MRR 라인 (series-1)
            const mrrPath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - d.mrr * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const mrrLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('d', mrrPath);
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-1)');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            mrrLine.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(mrrLine);

            // 축 레이블
            data.forEach((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
                text.setAttribute('x', x);
                text.setAttribute('y', height - margin.bottom + 20);
                text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');
                text.setAttribute('font-size', '12');
                text.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--text-muted)');
                text.textContent = 'M' + d.month;
                svg.appendChild(text);
            });
        }

        function renderCashChart() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const svg = document.getElementById('cashChart');
            const width = svg.clientWidth;
            const height = 400;
            const margin = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 40, left: 80 };
            const chartWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
            const chartHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

            const minValue = Math.min(...data.map(d => d.cumulativeCash));
            const maxValue = Math.max(...data.map(d => d.cumulativeCash));
            const range = maxValue - minValue;
            const scaleY = chartHeight / (range || 1);
            const scaleX = chartWidth / 11;

            svg.innerHTML = '';

            // 그리드라인
            for (let i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
                const y = margin.top + (chartHeight * i / 5);
                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
                line.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
                line.setAttribute('y1', y);
                line.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
                line.setAttribute('y2', y);
                line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--gridline)');
                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
                svg.appendChild(line);
            }

            // 영점 라인
            const zeroY = height - margin.bottom - (0 - minValue) * scaleY;
            const zeroLine = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('y1', zeroY);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('y2', zeroY);
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            zeroLine.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '4,4');
            svg.appendChild(zeroLine);

            // 축
            const xAxis = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');
            xAxis.setAttribute('x1', margin.left);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y1', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('x2', width - margin.right);
            xAxis.setAttribute('y2', height - margin.bottom);
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--baseline)');
            xAxis.setAttribute('stroke-width', '1');
            svg.appendChild(xAxis);

            // 영역
            const areaPath = 'M ' + margin.left + ' ' + (height - margin.bottom) + ' ' +
                data.map((d, i) => {
                    const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                    const y = height - margin.bottom - (d.cumulativeCash - minValue) * scaleY;
                    return `L ${x} ${y}`;
                }).join(' ') +
                ` L ${width - margin.right} ${height - margin.bottom} Z`;

            const area = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            area.setAttribute('d', areaPath);
            area.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--series-3)');
            area.setAttribute('opacity', '0.1');
            svg.appendChild(area);

            // 라인
            const linePath = data.map((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const y = height - margin.bottom - (d.cumulativeCash - minValue) * scaleY;
                return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x} ${y}`;
            }).join(' ');

            const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
            line.setAttribute('d', linePath);
            line.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--series-3)');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-width', '2');
            line.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
            line.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin', 'round');
            svg.appendChild(line);

            // 축 레이블
            data.forEach((d, i) => {
                const x = margin.left + i * scaleX;
                const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');
                text.setAttribute('x', x);
                text.setAttribute('y', height - margin.bottom + 20);
                text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');
                text.setAttribute('font-size', '12');
                text.setAttribute('fill', 'var(--text-muted)');
                text.textContent = 'M' + d.month;
                svg.appendChild(text);
            });
        }

        function renderTable() {
            const data = calculateFinancials();
            const tbody = document.getElementById('tableBody');

            tbody.innerHTML = data.map(d => `
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>M${d.month}</strong></td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.mrr)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.arr)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyRevenue)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyPaymentFee)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyInfraCost)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.monthlyCogs)}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.baseFixedCost)}</td>
                    <td>${d.monthlyDevCost > 0 ? formatCurrency(d.monthlyDevCost) : '—'}</td>
                    <td>${formatCurrency(d.totalFixedCost)}</td>
                    <td class="positive">${formatCurrency(d.monthlyContribution)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.monthlyCashFlow > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.monthlyCashFlow)}</td>
                    <td class="${d.cumulativeCash > 0 ? 'positive' : 'negative'}">${formatCurrency(d.cumulativeCash)}</td>
                </tr>
            `).join('');
        }

        function update() {
            renderKPIs();
            renderMRRChart();
            renderCashChart();
            renderTable();
        }

        Object.values(inputs).forEach(input => {
            input.addEventListener('change', update);
            input.addEventListener('input', update);
        });

        // 초기 렌더링
        update();

        // 윈도우 리사이즈 시 차트 다시 그리기
        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
            renderMRRChart();
            renderCashChart();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

이제 원가를 더 명확하게 분리했습니다:

- **결제 수수료**: 15% (기본값, 조정 가능)
- **인프라 비용**: 10% (기본값, 조정 가능)
- **합계 원가율**: 25%

테이블에서 각 비용을 분리해서 보여주고, **Contribution Margin**(매출 - 원가)을 별도 열로 표시해서 수익성을 더 명확하게 볼 수 있습니다. 이제 개발자 채용 후 Contribution이 고정비를 커버할 수 있는지 한눈에 파악할 수 있겠네요.

세 가지 시나리오(Bear/Base/Bull)를 비교하는 대시보드를 만들겠습니다.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>시나리오 분석 - 12개월 재무 모델</title>
    <style>
        * {
